<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila's All Asia, Segdwick sign venture.</title>
<headline>Manila's All Asia, Segdwick sign venture.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines All Asia Insurance and Management Corp said on Tuesday it had signed a joint venture with Sedgwick Group Plc.</p>
<p>All Asia said in a statement the joint venture will be called All Asia Sedgwick Insurance Brokers Corp.</p>
<p>All Asia did not say what stake each partner would hold. It also did not give details of the new firm's business plans.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
